                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "another VR shovelware shooting gallery\n\n+ good jump scare the first few times when they fly up to your face\n- but they don't actually do damage. there is no health bar\n\n+ environment and cockroach & gun models look ok\n- environment doesn't respond to shots except some objects can be knocked over. lacks power-ups\n\n+ small haptic response was added when shooting guns. probably doesn't drain batteries much?\n- only one gun type. infinite ammo and no reloading. \n\nyeah it's worth about $2. maybe good for overcoming insect phobia because you can't die.",
